  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u98a65513\" id=\"u98a65513\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1441b95f\" id=\"u1441b95f\">A： 暂停/继续</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub7ba6648\" id=\"ub7ba6648\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5048cfa1\" id=\"u5048cfa1\">Y： 头部控制/神经网络控制</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"z8ArR\" id=\"z8ArR\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uca071373\" id=\"uca071373\">指令调试</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u09f75187\" id=\"u09f75187\"><span data-lake-id=\"u116087d2\" id=\"u116087d2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">在 Ubuntu 上测试 USB 连接的 Xbox 手柄，最快的方法是用命令行工具。下面的步骤会先帮你确认系统是否识别了手柄，然后用工具进行交互测试。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"3dffabf7\" id=\"3dffabf7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u84e9d8c6\" id=\"u84e9d8c6\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">✅</span><span data-lake-id=\"ucc7d91f6\" id=\"ucc7d91f6\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> 第一步：确认系统识别</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u893d99d6\" id=\"u893d99d6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub070bc9f\" id=\"ub070bc9f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">首先，把 Xbox 手柄通过 USB 线连接到电脑。连接成功后，手柄上的</span><span data-lake-id=\"uc9ffa9ec\" id=\"uc9ffa9ec\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u27488314\" id=\"u27488314\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">Xbox 标志会亮起白色常亮灯</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8d264e6d\" id=\"u8d264e6d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">，这通常表示物理连接没问题</span><span data-lake-id=\"u5173b447\" id=\"u5173b447\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6a47c82f\" id=\"u6a47c82f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud1890031\" id=\"ud1890031\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">接下来，打开终端（Terminal），输入以下命令来查看系统是否找到了手柄设备：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ls%20%2Fdev%2Finput%2Fjs*%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TfngR%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u96369243\" id=\"u96369243\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2ad075c5\" id=\"u2ad075c5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">如果看到类似</span><span data-lake-id=\"u15d3de4d\" id=\"u15d3de4d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf4641598\" id=\"uf4641598\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u04210003\" id=\"u04210003\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 242)\">/dev/input/js0</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf01651a2\" id=\"uf01651a2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u0ec6189a\" id=\"u0ec6189a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">的输出，就说明系统已经成功检测到了你的手柄</span><span data-lake-id=\"u388965eb\" id=\"u388965eb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">。后面的数字</span><span data-lake-id=\"u84971631\" id=\"u84971631\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"uedf54c8e\" id=\"uedf54c8e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua4608e47\" id=\"ua4608e47\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 242)\">0</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ueab25713\" id=\"ueab25713\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ua5ecb8d5\" id=\"ua5ecb8d5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">可能不同（比如</span><span data-lake-id=\"u98978e2d\" id=\"u98978e2d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u1cf64d44\" id=\"u1cf64d44\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7dd82a96\" id=\"u7dd82a96\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 242)\">js1</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u32861bb5\" id=\"u32861bb5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">），这代表你是第几个连接的手柄。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"93e84474\" id=\"93e84474\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba5807a2\" id=\"uba5807a2\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">🎮</span><span data-lake-id=\"ue99d6e2a\" id=\"ue99d6e2a\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> 第二步：安装并运行测试工具</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ude788343\" id=\"ude788343\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue907d919\" id=\"ue907d919\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">Ubuntu 软件源里有一个叫</span><span data-lake-id=\"u60fa9211\" id=\"u60fa9211\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u623eaeaf\" id=\"u623eaeaf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u58a5d527\" id=\"u58a5d527\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 242)\">joystick</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue8e801b3\" id=\"ue8e801b3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u94c5ae3a\" id=\"u94c5ae3a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">的软件包，它提供的</span><span data-lake-id=\"u003c0a01\" id=\"u003c0a01\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"ud78349de\" id=\"ud78349de\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8e8dfc3b\" id=\"u8e8dfc3b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 242)\">jstest</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u73f3cce7\" id=\"u73f3cce7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u7909891d\" id=\"u7909891d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">命令能很好地完成这个测试任务。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u19d110d8\" id=\"u19d110d8\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u15a9108c\" id=\"u15a9108c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">安装工具</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"udddcdd95\" id=\"udddcdd95\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">：在终端中运行下面这条命令来安装它</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub87234f4\" id=\"ub87234f4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20apt%20install%20joystick%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q0F1D%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ucf7e3249\" id=\"ucf7e3249\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaa4e5da4\" id=\"uaa4e5da4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">开始测试</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf7c2ed9b\" id=\"uf7c2ed9b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">：安装完成后，运行下面的命令，记得把</span><span data-lake-id=\"u78eb3527\" id=\"u78eb3527\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u1d3df75e\" id=\"u1d3df75e\"><span data-lake-id=\"udfa726a6\" id=\"udfa726a6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 242)\">js0</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u02f4e82e\" id=\"u02f4e82e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u3f260d95\" id=\"u3f260d95\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">替换成你在第一步中看到的实际设备名：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22jstest%20%2Fdev%2Finput%2Fjs0%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cxrl9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u0342246d\" id=\"u0342246d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaa78d57a\" id=\"uaa78d57a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">执行后，终端会变成一个实时数据面板</span><span data-lake-id=\"ubd58b8f6\" id=\"ubd58b8f6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">：</span></p><ul list=\"u362dab82\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u31e0a784\" data-lake-id=\"u2c43f916\" id=\"u2c43f916\"><code data-lake-id=\"uca5814c1\" id=\"uca5814c1\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucd33fe54\" id=\"ucd33fe54\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 242)\">Axes</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5ec89d5b\" id=\"u5ec89d5b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">：代表摇杆和扳机键。当你推动摇杆或按下扳机时，后面的数值会发生变化。</span></li><li fid=\"u31e0a784\" data-lake-id=\"u58996e32\" id=\"u58996e32\"><code data-lake-id=\"u42107a10\" id=\"u42107a10\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3a8e461e\" id=\"u3a8e461e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 242)\">Buttons</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"u87f44284\" id=\"u87f44284\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">：代表按键。按下手柄上的 A、B、X、Y 等按钮时，对应的值会从</span><span data-lake-id=\"u6fd8fac1\" id=\"u6fd8fac1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u0493107d\" id=\"u0493107d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u90934518\" id=\"u90934518\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 242)\">off</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7c011074\" id=\"u7c011074\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u917970a8\" id=\"u917970a8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">变成</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud0565da5\" id=\"ud0565da5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"uc675370f\" id=\"uc675370f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3d8e1348\" id=\"u3d8e1348\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 242)\">on</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubf8180ab\" id=\"ubf8180ab\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ufc108408\" id=\"ufc108408\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4a599304\" id=\"u4a599304\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">在这个界面里，你可以实际操作手柄上的所有按键和摇杆，如果都能看到相应的数值或状态变化，就说明你的 Xbox 手柄在 Ubuntu 下工作正常。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc867ee4d\" id=\"uc867ee4d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda28f09b\" id=\"uda28f09b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"BN390\" id=\"BN390\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u14a2cd65\" id=\"u14a2cd65\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">代码驱动</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u21715a62\" id=\"u21715a62\"><span data-lake-id=\"u087a0ef7\" id=\"u087a0ef7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">运行xbox_controller.py, 检查每一个按键是否正确，推动摇杆，查看值是否正确</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20pygame%5Cnfrom%20threading%20import%20Thread%5Cnfrom%20queue%20import%20Queue%5Cnimport%20time%5Cnimport%20numpy%20as%20np%5Cnfrom%20mini_bdx_runtime.buttons%20import%20Buttons%5Cn%5Cn%5CnX_RANGE%20%3D%20%5B-0.15%2C%200.15%5D%5CnY_RANGE%20%3D%20%5B-0.2%2C%200.2%5D%5CnYAW_RANGE%20%3D%20%5B-1.0%2C%201.0%5D%5Cn%5Cn%23%20rads%5CnNECK_PITCH_RANGE%20%3D%20%5B-0.34%2C%201.1%5D%5CnHEAD_PITCH_RANGE%20%3D%20%5B-0.78%2C%200.3%5D%5CnHEAD_YAW_RANGE%20%3D%20%5B-0.5%2C%200.5%5D%5CnHEAD_ROLL_RANGE%20%3D%20%5B-0.5%2C%200.5%5D%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnclass%20XBoxController%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__init__(self%2C%20command_freq%2C%20only_head_control%3DFalse)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.command_freq%20%3D%20command_freq%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.head_control_mode%20%3D%20only_head_control%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.only_head_control%20%3D%20only_head_control%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.last_commands%20%3D%20%5B0.0%2C%200.0%2C%200.0%2C%200.0%2C%200.0%2C%200.0%2C%200.0%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.last_left_trigger%20%3D%200.0%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.last_right_trigger%20%3D%200.0%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20pygame.init()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.p1%20%3D%20pygame.joystick.Joystick(0)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.p1.init()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20print(f%5C%22Loaded%20joystick%20with%20%7Bself.p1.get_numaxes()%7D%20axes.%5C%22)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.cmd_queue%20%3D%20Queue(maxsize%3D1)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.A_pressed%20%3D%20False%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.B_pressed%20%3D%20False%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.X_pressed%20%3D%20False%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.Y_pressed%20%3D%20False%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.LB_pressed%20%3D%20False%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.RB_pressed%20%3D%20False%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.buttons%20%3D%20Buttons()%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Thread(target%3Dself.commands_worker%2C%20daemon%3DTrue).start()%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20commands_worker(self)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20while%20True%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20